{
  "_readme": [
    "Short looping 'Show Me' clips that demonstrate a vocabulary word (the real thing in motion).",
    "Parsed by lib/core/services/action_clip_service.dart; downloaded + cached on first view (NOT bundled).",
    "The 'Show Me' button appears on any card that has a clip here (viewer + Picture-Word game).",
    "",
    "You can paste a share-page URL directly — streamable.com/<id> pages are auto-resolved to the",
    "signed CDN mp4 by lib/core/services/media_url_resolver.dart (the mp4 is cached, so its expiry",
    "doesn't matter after first view). Direct .mp4 / .gif URLs work too (a .gif plays as a looping image).",
    "",
    "Resolution order: overrides['<Category label>__<english word lowercased>'] (used below), else",
    "<base_url>/<Category label>/<English word>.<ext> when base_url is set.",
    "",
    "Not covered yet (no 'Show Me' button until added): Colors & Shapes and Numbers (use the photo",
    "manifest's 'galleries' instead), and the Actions/verbs category."
  ],
